msgstr "IP 地址来源"

msgid "Outbound WAN Interface"
msgstr "出站 WAN 接口"

msgid "Bind this rule to a specific WAN interface for multi-WAN setups, or keep \"auto\"."
msgstr "多 WAN 场景下可绑定指定外网出口，单线保持 auto 即可。"

